    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but i cant really get an appointment until next week and i'm struggling to sleep because i cant breathe. just how risky is it really? like is there a specific reason why it's a bad idea or is it just a standard warning they give everyone? i just need to know if i can take one dose so i can get through the night.",
